  "lines": [
    "Made it to Manchester",
    "By rfay - Posted on September 15th, 2005",
    "Tagged: New England",
    "DSC00071",
    "Originally uploaded by refay.",
    "We got our bikes all put together today and got on the road. The wonderful folks at Alternative Bike helped us get all set and gave us an idea where to go. Our first little loop before family reunion on Saturday is to ride up and over toward the coast and back down toward Exeter.",
    "We're riding this afternoon in a light rain, sometimes heavier, and just working our way north."
